                "text": "The\u00a0One Big Beautiful Bill Act\u00a0puts rural America\u00a0FIRST. \n\n\u2705 Cuts taxes for farmers, ranchers, families, and small businesses.\n\u2705 Protects rural health care and rural hospitals.\n\u2705 Overturns Biden\u2019s one-size-fits-all staffing mandate that would cut seniors\u2019 access to care.\n\u2705 Helps American farmers\u00a0compete by increasing access to global markets.",
