                "text": "This week, I hosted a veterans roundtable at the Michigan Veteran Home in Chesterfield with veterans, representatives from the @DeptVetAffairs, and community groups. \n\nWe discussed ways to expand community care, improve access to mental health resources, and tackle unnecessary red tape at the VA.\n\nIf you know a veteran in need, please don\u2019t hesitate to reach out to my office\u2014we are here to help.",
