                "text": "The St. Clair County Emergency Operations Center is vital to the safety and security of Southeast Michigan.\n\nIt was great to meet with Emergency Manager Justin Westmiller and his team to discuss how their operations bring together law enforcement, fire, EMS, public health, and emergency management to keep us safe during public emergencies.\n\nI\u2019m grateful for their service and remain committed to supporting their mission to keep St. Clair County and our surrounding communities safe.",
